  "limitations": [
    "Group (layer) elements are not counted toward the 15-element cap; the 13 drawn components are.",
    "Boundary (GUI) classes are not drawn: they reach the controllers through SystemServicesController (and UserLoginController); SystemServicesController has no persistence dependency and is not drawn.",
    "Entity classes are drawn in V1, not here; which entities each service reads or writes is listed in README.md (access matrix) and in evidence_model.json relations from ReportService/UserService to entities.",
    "ReportService and UserService sit in package Entity (domain layer) but call Database.PersistenceService directly; no repository/DAO layer separates them.",
    "Queries are built from attribute-name strings (e.g. 'citizenReporting.userId', 'location.municipalArea', 'currentStatusName', 'credentials.email'): renaming mapped fields breaks them without compile errors (claims on lines in ReportService.java and UserService.java)."
  ],
